00:05:32.359 --> 00:05:36.359
chosen to be with us, and this is not an exclusive

00:05:36.399 --> 00:05:38.399
opportunity or a club.

00:05:38.399 --> 00:05:41.399
Our vision for the table is that it really is

00:05:41.399 --> 00:05:43.399
