00:05:51.399 --> 00:05:53.399
Let us know where you're watching from.

00:05:53.399 --> 00:05:55.399
We want to be able to welcome you personally.

00:05:55.399 --> 00:06:00.399
And you are in for a really, really special night tonight.

00:06:00.399 --> 00:06:03.399
Between the music and the message,

00:06:03.399 --> 00:06:05.399
it's going to be really, really incredible.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:07.440
So you picked a great night to be here.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.440
