I just have a couple of announcements

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.440
and ways to get connected here at the table.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.440
They are both about our meetups,

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.440
which are our small groups.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:33.440
The first one is our book club,

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:35.480
