00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:37.480
It's going to be meeting next Saturday,

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.480
July 18th at 10 a.m.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:44.480
via Google Meets

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.480
to discuss this month's book selection.

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:48.480
