00:07:36.559 --> 00:07:38.559
The second meetup

00:07:38.559 --> 00:07:40.559
is for our teenagers.

00:07:40.559 --> 00:07:42.559
Whether you call

00:07:42.559 --> 00:07:44.559
the table home or not,

00:07:44.559 --> 00:07:46.559
this group is open to you.

00:07:46.559 --> 00:07:48.559
It's open to all teenagers.

00:07:48.559 --> 00:07:50.559
And it's going to be a four-week study

00:07:50.559 --> 00:07:52.559
to discuss race.

00:07:54.559 --> 00:07:56.559
And it's going to be facilitated

00:07:56.559 --> 00:07:58.559
by Maggie Tilford.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.600
And it's going to start this coming Wednesday evening

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:02.600
and go each Wednesday

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.600
for four consecutive weeks.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.600
So you'll be done before school starts

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.600
or who knows what's happening with school,

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.600
but it'll be done

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.600
before the proposed school start

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.600
in the middle of August.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:16.600
And it's an open group

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.600
for any teens who might be wanting

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.600
or needing a space

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.600
to discuss race.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.600
Talk a little bit about our country's history,

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.600
how we got to this current moment

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.640
in our society.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.640
So all teens are welcome to that.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.640
If you would like more information,

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:34.640
you can contact Maggie

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.640
at M-A-G-G-I-E

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.640
at thetabletx.org.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.640
As we transition to worship,

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.640
I just wanted to share something

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.640
that I've been thinking about

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.640
lately and actually journaled about

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.640
recently.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.640
It was inspired by

00:08:54.679 --> 00:08:56.679
the passage in Joshua 2415

00:08:56.679 --> 00:08:58.679
that says

00:08:58.679 --> 00:09:00.679
choose this day

00:09:00.679 --> 00:09:02.679
whom you will serve.

00:09:02.679 --> 00:09:04.679
And the reason why this

00:09:04.679 --> 00:09:06.679
scripture stuck out to me

00:09:06.679 --> 00:09:08.679
at this moment in time

00:09:08.679 --> 00:09:10.679
is that I found myself

00:09:10.679 --> 00:09:12.679
with just

00:09:12.679 --> 00:09:14.679
the not knowing about how

00:09:14.679 --> 00:09:16.679
things are going to go,

00:09:16.679 --> 00:09:18.679
the uncertainty,

00:09:18.679 --> 00:09:20.679
all of the what-ifs.

00:09:20.679 --> 00:09:22.679
I found myself

00:09:22.719 --> 00:09:24.719
either throughout the day or when I wake up

00:09:24.719 --> 00:09:26.719
in the morning with my jaw clenched,

00:09:26.719 --> 00:09:28.719
my hands in fists,

00:09:28.719 --> 00:09:30.719
breathing very shallow,

00:09:30.719 --> 00:09:32.719
and just

00:09:32.719 --> 00:09:34.719
finding myself a little stressed out

00:09:34.719 --> 00:09:36.719
and realizing that

00:09:36.719 --> 00:09:38.719
I can allow myself to go into

00:09:38.719 --> 00:09:40.719
worry mode and what-ifs

00:09:40.719 --> 00:09:42.719
scenario mode really, really

00:09:42.719 --> 00:09:44.719
quickly.

00:09:44.719 --> 00:09:46.719
The passage

00:09:46.719 --> 00:09:48.719
choose this day whom you will serve

00:09:48.719 --> 00:09:50.719
just challenged me

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.760
and I realized I've been

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.760
choosing stress and

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.760
choosing to live there

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:58.760
versus choosing just

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.760
handing it over to God and not that the

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.760
circumstances go away but it certainly

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.760
puts me in a healthier place

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.760
to process through and to make

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.760
decisions and to respond versus

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.760
react. So I'd like to

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.760
read what I wrote in my journal

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.760
and then after

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.760
that we're going to transition to

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.760
a wonderful song

00:10:18.799 --> 00:10:20.799
led by Carter Livingston

00:10:20.799 --> 00:10:22.799
assisted by his son Preston, which you're

00:10:22.799 --> 00:10:24.799
really going to like.

00:10:24.799 --> 00:10:26.799
Choose this day

00:10:26.799 --> 00:10:28.799
whom you will serve.

00:10:28.799 --> 00:10:30.799
God, I choose you.

00:10:30.799 --> 00:10:32.799
I will continue to choose you

00:10:32.799 --> 00:10:34.799
when fear, anxiety

00:10:34.799 --> 00:10:36.799
and worry try to take over.

00:10:36.799 --> 00:10:38.799
I will breathe you in

00:10:38.799 --> 00:10:40.799
when my mind starts entertaining

00:10:40.799 --> 00:10:42.799
what-ifs scenarios.

00:10:42.799 --> 00:10:44.799
I will pray when my mind

00:10:44.799 --> 00:10:46.799
and heart are unsettled.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.840
I will give you my raw

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.840
honest, unedited

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:52.840
feelings in exchange for

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.840
your peace that surpasses

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.840
my own understanding.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.840
I will choose to breathe in

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.840
your spirit when I am overwhelmed.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.840
I will be reminded

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:04.840
of your goodness, faithfulness

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.840
and wonder

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:08.840
when I pause to soak in

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:10.840
a beautiful sunset or

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.840
contemplate the sure and steady growth

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.840
of an oak tree as it weathers

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:16.880
harsh seasons.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.880
I will choose the way of

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.880
love, compassion

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:22.880
and perseverance.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.880
I will choose you when this

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.880
gets difficult.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.880
God, I will continue

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:30.880
to choose you.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.880
Amen.

